flowchart TD

  subgraph INTRO[" Introduction — S · C · Q "]
    direction TB
    S["SITUATION<br/>N candidate proposition features<br/>on the roadmap; finite build and<br/>launch capacity this cycle"]
    C["COMPLICATION<br/>They cannot all ship. Choosing by<br/>conviction or loudest voice risks<br/>spending the cycle on features<br/>that will not pay back"]
    Q["QUESTION<br/>Which features do we launch,<br/>and in what order?"]
    S --> C --> Q
  end

  Q ==> GT

  GT["ANSWER / GOVERNING THOUGHT<br/>Launch A and C this cycle.<br/>Stage B behind a capability build.<br/>Drop D and E."]

  GT ==> K1
  GT ==> K2
  GT ==> K3

  K1["KEY LINE 1<br/>Only A and C show proven customer pull<br/>— they clear the OCV threshold,<br/>D and E fall below it"]
  K2["KEY LINE 2<br/>Their economics hold up — positive<br/>risk-adjusted return that survives<br/>the long-run defensibility test"]
  K3["KEY LINE 3<br/>Nothing in delivery breaks them —<br/>capabilities exist or are buyable<br/>inside the launch window"]

  K1 --> D1["OCV score by feature, ranked<br/>across all N candidates"]
  K1 --> D2["Where the threshold sits,<br/>and why it sits there"]
  K1 --> D3["Evidence behind the scores:<br/>research base, sample, recency"]
  K1 --> D4["Why D and E fell out<br/>— stated, not implied"]

  K2 --> V1["Base-case revenue and margin<br/>forecast per surviving feature"]
  K2 --> V2["Adjusted for time-to-launch<br/>and delivery confidence"]
  K2 --> V3["Zook's 3 checks: does the<br/>advantage repeat, or erode?"]
  K2 --> V4["What would have to be true<br/>to change the call"]

  K3 --> F1["Capabilities each feature requires"]
  K3 --> F2["Have / buy / build, per capability"]
  K3 --> F3["Time-to-launch + confidence band"]
  K3 --> F4["Dependencies and gating risks<br/>— why B is staged, not dropped"]

  F3 -.->|"feeds the discount"| V2

  K1 --> SW
  K2 --> SW
  K3 --> SW
  SW["SO WHAT<br/>Sequencing, owners, and the<br/>decisions needed this week"]

  classDef intro fill:#F4F1EC,stroke:#B8AFA2,color:#3D3A34
  classDef answer fill:#2F4858,stroke:#2F4858,color:#FFFFFF
  classDef key fill:#5B8A9E,stroke:#3E6A7D,color:#FFFFFF
  classDef support fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#B8C4CC,color:#2F4858
  classDef sowhat fill:#C9A227,stroke:#9C7C15,color:#2B2308

  class S,C,Q intro
  class GT answer
  class K1,K2,K3 key
  class D1,D2,D3,D4,V1,V2,V3,V4,F1,F2,F3,F4 support
  class SW sowhat
